# Kinex toolbox governance

- Put every GPT-formulated tool in `toolbox/tools/<name>`.
- Add `metadata.json` with integer `generality.score` and `level.score` values
  from 1 through 10, plus rationale, assumptions, limitations, and provenance.
- Score the present implementation. Do not score based on the tool name or a
  future refactor.
- Prefer small deterministic tools and compose complex behavior from declared
  lower-level dependencies.
- A tool may depend only on tools with a strictly lower level score.
- Preserve measurements, units, frames, confidence, timestamps, and thresholds
  instead of returning only a boolean.
- Run `python toolbox/scripts/toolbox.py validate --write-registry` after every
  toolbox change.

